        "created_at": "2013-03-27T20:42:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What's the official ruling here? Does it stack over time? If she keeps using her base power, does she keep amassing -1 Damage Received tokens? Or do they go away?</p><p><span>Thanks!</span></p>",
